abstract: >
  Reproducibility code and nonrestricted computational artifacts supporting
  the published ACS ES&T Water study "Operationalizing Nitrogen Compliance:
  A Leakage-Safe, Alarm-Budget Framework for Wastewater Treatment Early Warning."
  Restricted raw wastewater-treatment datasets are not redistributed.

